   "subject": "Variable Substitution in includeHTML?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div><div>Hello,<br><br></div>Is something like this possible<br><br>HTML:<br></div>&lt;b&gt;Date as Of&lt;/b&gt;${latestDate}<br><br></div>includeHTML(path to html)<br><br>and the includeHTML will substitute the R variable latestDate?<br>\r\n\r\n<br></div>Regards<br>Saptarshi<br><br></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "0mkfHDyEDf8J",
   "from": "Ramnath Vaidyanathan",
   "author": "c6ca7877bef91eef",
   "date": "2013-05-07T20:44:47Z",
   "subject": "Re: Variable Substitution in includeHTML?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "You could use something like this. It is modeled after includeMarkdown in Shiny. You can now use code chunks in your Rmd file and include it in your UI. This is untested.<div><br></div><div><pre style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:16px;word-wrap:break-word;width:744px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\">includeRmd <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">function</span><span>(</span>path<span>){</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\">  <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">if</span> <span>(</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">!</span>require<span>(</span>knitr<span>))</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\">    stop<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;knitr package is not installed&quot;</span><span>)</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\">  <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">if</span> <span>(</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">!</span>require<span>(</span>markdown<span>))</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\">    stop<span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;Markdown package is not installed&quot;</span><span>)</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\">  shiny<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">:::</span>dependsOnFile<span>(</span>path<span>)</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\">  html <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> knitr<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">::</span>knit2html<span>(</span>path<span>,</span> fragment.only <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">TRUE</span><span>)</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\">  Encoding<span>(</span>html<span>)</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&#39;UTF-8&#39;</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\">  <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">return</span><span>(</span>HTML<span>(</span>html<span>))</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\"><span>}</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace\"><span><br></span></div><div><span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Best,</font></span></div><div><span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Ramnath</font></span></div></pre></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><br>On Tuesday, May 7, 2013 4:36:55 PM UTC-4, Saptarshi Joy Guha wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div><div>Hello,<br><br></div>Is something like this possible<br><br>HTML:<br></div>&lt;b&gt;Date as Of&lt;/b&gt;${latestDate}<br><br></div>includeHTML(path to html)<br><br>and the includeHTML will substitute the R variable latestDate?<br>\r\n\r\n<br></div>Regards<br>Saptarshi<br><br></div>\r\n</blockquote></div>"
    ]
   ]
